	<div class="message-userContent lbContainer js-lbContainer " data-lb-id="post-782549" data-lb-caption-desc="Wairau · Sep 26, 2006 at 3:10 PM">

		
			

	
		
	

		

		<article class="message-body js-selectToQuote">
			
				
			

			<div>
				
					<div class="bbWrapper">We operated NX 3D CAD software (previously known as Unigraphics), and have ben asked if we can read Catia V5models.<br/>
<br/>
My question is do Catia files contain the drg file also (like NX does) or is the drg a separate file.  The files we have are Catia part files and there is some suggestion that these wont contain the drgs.<br/>
<br/>
Has anybody had any experience of translating Catia V5 files to NX either vis specialised software or the use of STEP files?<br/>
<br/>
Graham Murphy</div>
				
			</div>

			<div class="js-selectToQuoteEnd">&nbsp;</div>
			
				

	

		
